        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Anna Maria, Florida; Anna Maria Island; Bradenton Beach, Florida\n- Organizations: Manatee County\n- Water bodies: Gulf of Mexico; Longboat Pass; Longboat Key; Anna Maria Sound; Tampa Bay\n\nFacts:\n- Anna Maria, Florida, is a city in Manatee County, Florida, United States.\n- Anna Maria, Florida, occupies the northern part of Anna Maria Island and is one of three municipalities on the island.\n- Anna Maria Island is bounded on the west by the Gulf of Mexico, on the south by Longboat Pass, on the east by Anna Maria Sound, and on the north by Tampa Bay.\n- Longboat Pass separates Anna Maria Island from Longboat Key.\n- Bradenton Beach, Florida, is a city on Anna Maria Island in Manatee County, Florida, United States.",
